{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Franklin ignores Sabrine and continues his conversation with the mender.","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:10:31.878000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T19:10:37.119000Z","id":"868208478794170480","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Its possible.... but isn't mending the unbreakable foundation blocks new territory for us all?  The only way I can do it is my way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:11:00.636000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868208599413952562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Ed waves at Sabrine and Roy and leaves for <#850785753365872641>","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:11:15.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868208661670015057","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine shrugs, and heads over to Roy, waving to Ed and keeping an eye on the conversation. 'Won't even acknowledge my points, huh...'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:11:33.742000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868208738270593074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy waves back to Ed, and then shrugs. \"Gotta pick your battles.\" He sits by a tree to watch and listen, and gestures to Sab to join him.","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:12:46.377000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868209042923864115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine sits down next to him. '...what's his problem with love, anyway?' her cheeks puff out.","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:13:32.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868209236428062731","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"In the thick of war, can we really depend on this to set the direction?\" Franklin is getting more concerned. \"I'm to report to the other Masons. Mender I have grown to like you. But love is not enough. It is good. It inspires good things. But people can be in love with things that hurt them too.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:15:12.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868209654927327293","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Hard to quantify, I guess. Can't get a bucket of it. With machines, you want things to be predictable. In the woods, you accept that some things just come from nature. I like sitting somewhere in between.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:15:45.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868209792609570826","reply_to_id":"868209236428062731","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Love isnt the only word there.... talk to your *Brothers* all you wish..... I have grown to like and respect you... but we wont see eye to eye.... let the *Family* know what was written here today\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:16:23.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868209952186064927","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"This is an oversimplification, and chaotic. Love is not the same thing as wisdom. As kindness even. Love can be cruel or unrequited.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:16:25.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868209963158351912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...' she gets a slight grin. 'We could really mess with him right now...'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:16:54.065000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210081802649640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...not that he'd notice, most likely. We're a bit out of the way here.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:17:52.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210327135866911","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Family is not chosen. Families too can be cruel and uncaring. You can love a father who beats you, a brother who throws their life to gambling or drink.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:17:56.167000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210342277308496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Family is always chosen.. blood is not.  I know not who my kin is..... but I know who chose to raise me... and who I have chosen to raise myself\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:18:48.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210560360124429","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"He's a smart man. He'll figure out why those words were put there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:18:51.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210573639311400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I hope so.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:19:19.949000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210693684465695","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It is easy to say family is chosen, when a people murder one another for the right to mate. It is not as simple for the rest of us, mender.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:20:28.118000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868210979605995580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"We are raped by our biology.... forced into a lack of free will.... would you say the same to a slave forced to sleep with its master?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:22:09.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868211403847254037","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he shakes his head \"anyway friend.... \"he offers his hand \"I know if I need you.... youll be there\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:23:15.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868211683192098826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I will be there when you call. But take my advice. Repair the cornerstone in Hampstead. Your job is to mend. Not simply to replace. I do hope this stone is enough.\" He shakes The mender's hand. He then takes the tail of his kite. A strong gust of wind carries Franklin away.","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:25:38.271000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T19:26:16.100000Z","id":"868212280481939486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he quietly says \"I do too\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:26:05.874000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868212396257341491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(bye Mrs. Poppins)","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:26:08.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868212406541758504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'This cornerstone... would it happen to be at the Gazette by any chance?'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:26:35.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868212518978461776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"yes.... its damaged in a way I know not how to repair.  Cannot trace the words.... cannot add new words.... cannot chip away at it..... the magic is failing....\" he shakes his head \"I have so much to learn.... and so little time to complete....\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:28:43.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868213057439014982","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...is there anything we can do to help? Maybe check the library? I feel like they wouldn't quite be happy with water everywhere... I've heard slight horror stories about angering those librarians.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:29:56.452000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868213363371540551","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I wonder how one would even repair a magic stone without replacing it. All this magic is so complicated.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:32:59.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868214131386376202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she shrugs. 'Perhaps if somehow the... soul? Spirit? of the stone could be transferred to a new, better body... worked for me, right?'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:34:07.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868214416276062299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Of course, being able to do that is a different matter...'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:39:01.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868215648667447386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He shrugs \"I may need more tools.... more meditation.... don't worry too much about it.... don't you all have so much to do?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:40:24.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868215998057152642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(~~no, we're asleep for the 6pm events~~)\n'Perhaps, but... well, isn't it sort of my job to help you at this point?'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:41:03.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868216161978949650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He laughs \"your job?  I helped you out of a bad situation.... you don't owe me a thing\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:42:44.134000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868216583263244318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...still. Friends help each other out, am I right? Besides, I guess I live in this city now. I don't particularly want it to collapse.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:44:32.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868217039662227556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'm mostly preparing myself, and figuring things out. For example, I figured out how to turn one man's trash into another one's treasure.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:44:42.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868217077658423377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Take these words to heart....\" he points to the stone \"that is the best favor a person could do.... prove me correct in this\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:46:38.040000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868217564336099359","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Well, we did move onto the Voice yesterday. They're like the family I never had.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:47:58.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868217900417314876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'We're just... working together to help each other out, and I wouldn't be surprised if everyone on there helped the city in some way already, let alone in the future.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:49:19.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868218242349543474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
